---
source: crates/daemon/tests/integration/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Review a later email's resolution offer. Defaults to a read-only preview

Usage: mxr todo resolve [OPTIONS] <TODO_ID> <SUGGESTION_ID> [ACTION]

Arguments:
  <TODO_ID>
  <SUGGESTION_ID>
  [ACTION]         [default: preview] [possible values: preview, accept, dismiss, undo]

Options:
      --dry-run            Validate the selected action without applying it
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
